include VERSION LICENSE README.md README_CN.md CHANGELOG.md CONTRIBUTING.md requirements-dev.txt .gitignore .gitattributes pyproject.toml setup.py
recursive-include awesome_latex_skills *.py
graft scripts
graft latex-rescue
graft latex-polish
graft latex-fmt
graft paper-read
graft pdf2tex
graft assets
graft docs
graft examples
graft evaluation
graft maintenance
graft tests
graft .github
global-exclude *.pyc *.pyo
prune work
prune dist
prune build
prune evaluation-runs
